      "number": 23,
      "answer": "$3-2i$",
      "solution": "$x=\\frac{1}{1+2i}=\\frac{(1-2i)}{(1+2i)(1-2i)}=\\frac{1-2i}{5}$\n$x=\\frac{1-2i}{5}$를 변형하면 $5x-1=-2i$\n양변을 제곱하면 $5x^{2}-2x+1=0$ 이므로\n$5x^{3}-2x^{2}+6x+2=(5x^{2}-2x+1)\\times x+5x+2$\n$=5x+2$\n$=5\\times\\left(\\frac{1-2i}{5}\\right)+2=3-2i$",
      "topic": "",
      "difficulty": ""
